s everyone's progress, one time only. The economy, perks, loadout and the order things unlock in all changed a lot in this update, and old progress just doesn't line up with the new game anymore.Reset: cores, perks, unlocks, codex, re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:37:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030843","verified_at":"2026-10-22T06:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963530-1846651706695595","game_id":"steam-4963530","kind":"announcement","title":"PHOSPHOR — LIVE DEVELOPER STREAM & GAMEPLAY SHOWCASE Oct 20th 6pm CST","summary":"PHOSPHOR — LIVE DEVELOPER STREAM & GAMEPLAY SHOWCASEWith launch just around the corner, we're going live for an evening of PHOSPHOR gameplay, developer insights, and special guest appearances!Join the developer of PHOSPHOR alongside Twitch streamer Malkail & TheRenegadeJester for a live look inside the Underfab. We'll be showcasing gameplay, diving into runs, exploring the arsenal, and putting PHOSPHOR through its paces ahead of launch.Expect intense combat, ridiculous weapon combinations, dange","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:54:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963530-1846018067939856","game_id":"steam-4963530","kind":"announcement","title":"Halloween DLC Pack is FREE FOR ALL!","summary":"Halloween DLC Pack is coming! FREE FOR ALL!This pack contains tons of Halloween themed game content, free for all players!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T03:10:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939856","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963530-1841579228664612","game_id":"steam-4963530","kind":"announcement","title":"PHOSPHR Demo is Now Live!","summary":"The PHOSPHOR demo is finally here. This is an early build, and it's going to be rough around the edges. That's intentional. Right now, I need players to break things, find problems, test weapons, push the limits, and tell me what works — and what doesn't. Your feedback during this demo is going to directly shape PHOSPHOR as it moves toward its full release on October 31st. So jump in, descend as far as you can, experiment with everything, and please let me know what you find.I'm incredibly excit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T07:14:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664612","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963530-1840944183782381","game_id":"steam-4963530","kind":"update","title":"Balancing and Scaling Update V2","summary":"Balancing and Scaling Update V2 Most of this update came out of one complaint, and it's one we agreed with. About halfway into a run, new guns stop mattering. You find something, you look at the card, you run the numbers in your head, and you put it back. Not because the gun is bad. It's because the one in your hands has eaten four wheel spins and six fusions, and the new one hasn't. We went and measured it, and it was worse than it felt. Against a legendary you'd invested in, three of the 153 g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T15:55:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782381","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963530-1840310314353337","game_id":"steam-4963530","kind":"announcement","title":"Massive Feature Updates","summary":"The biggest update yet is liveThis past week has been a heavy one. Every boss got torn down and rebuilt, co-op got a serious power correction, guns feel faster in the hand, and there's a pile of new weapons, enemies, and quality-of-life to dig into. Here's everything. All 14 bosses, rebuilt from scratchEvery boss in the game has been redrawn at full fidelity with per-limb animation instead of scaled-up sprites — and several got brand-new attacks to match. New looks and new tricks for THE MAW, th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T07:10:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353337","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963530-1839676055881494","game_id":"steam-4963530","kind":"announcement","title":"PHOSPHOR Early Access launch!","summary":"PHOSPHOR's Steam page is live. Descend nineteen biomes of a dying industrial underworld, scavenge guns and cyberspells, and see how far a run-built loadout gets you before the dark takes it back. Early Access is on the way — WISHLIST AND SHARE! it's the biggest way to help us launch.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T04:03:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881494","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4963530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4963530":"2026-10-26T15:39:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4963530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-2